{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>張智霖與袁詠儀愛子張慕童（魔童）向來作風低調，昨日（11月12日）正式踏入20歲生日。有好友在社交平台上載其最新慶生合照，令這位星二代最新外貌狀態曝光。相片中身高約1.85米兼五官深邃的他展現出令人意外的面貌。</p>\n<h2>張慕童慶生照流出展現陽光氣息</h2>\n<p>剛步入二字頭階段張慕童身穿淺藍色恤衫內襯白色T恤，對鏡頭豎起大拇指及舉起V字手勢，笑容陽光又不失斯文。近照中可見他輪廓愈見立體深邃，一雙電眼與高挺鼻樑完美遺傳爸爸張智霖俊朗外表與媽媽袁詠儀精緻五官，男神風範十足。這張由好友發布慶生合照迅速在網絡上瘋傳，讓外界一睹這位星二代成年後真實模樣。</p>\n<h2>張智霖袁詠儀全力支持愛子追夢</h2>\n<p>面對兒子成長與未來發展方向，張智霖早前受訪時笑認自己有「私心」，坦言支持兒子休學是希望把握他滿20歲獨立前最後時光，多點陪伴在側。袁詠儀最終亦選擇尊重並支持兒子決定，讓張慕童能夠無後顧之憂地發展個人興趣。父母兩人對兒子展現出極大包容度，全力支持他暫停學業去探索音樂領域可能性。</p>\n<h2>魔童休學暫別倫敦藝術大學校園</h2>\n<p>原本在英國倫敦藝術大學攻讀數碼媒體藝術張慕童，讀了一年後決定申請一年休學追逐音樂夢。他早前更在爸爸廣州及上海巡迴演唱會上驚喜擔任結他手伴奏，穩健台風獲外界一致好評。這次舞台經驗不僅展現出他在音樂方面天賦，也證明了他休學決定並非一時衝動，而是有備而來去實踐自己音樂理想。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚星二代顏值拍得住父親</h2>\n<p>慶生帖文曝光後隨即引來大批網民熱烈討論，不少人留言大讚「好靚仔」，更有人激讚他顏值完全拍得住當年全盛時期張智霖。前藝人岑潔儀亦忍不住在帖文下方留言大讚「Handsome」並附上心心眼表情符號。大眾對這位星二代外貌給予極高評價，紛紛表示期待他未來在音樂界會有更多亮眼表現。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945629699555198_183569336af6db9a52ab8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁詠儀 兒子 （圖片來源：IG@anitayuenwy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945629699555198_183569336af6db9a52ab8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@anitayuenwy）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297139942195_5887765116af6db9c23fd2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297139942195_5887765116af6db9c23fd2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@writetofay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297395994856_8240143696af6db9e56a60.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"NT9X0ddlAh2_ybMnro5wOB693cIRQe7MFUyXGRVMlxk.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297395994856_8240143696af6db9e56a60.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@writetofay）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297512089063_8529827506af6db9f72152.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"AHUtLDsInxrb3MQIMrNGw19vm_h9KOzV4zL3WuMy91o.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297512089063_8529827506af6db9f72152.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297613635642_14695310056af6dba089aa2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0rbGn2KGa53kXanOY94a8lWMt7V2mP9x5jJe6uYyXuo.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456297613635642_14695310056af6dba089aa2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175791165886289936_176930750168c79a6b19f1c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁詠儀 絲打圍爐 魔童曾貼出與袁詠儀的合照，被指兩母子餅印一樣！（圖片來源：IG@cheung_morton）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175791165886289936_176930750168c79a6b19f1c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>魔童曾貼出與袁詠儀的合照，被指兩母子餅印一樣！（圖片來源：IG@cheung_morton）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:59:30.708943+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1067,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:43:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T09:52:51.554513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:52:51.554513+00:00","content_hash":"55021cfb447ebe25ad29d74a0dd2b627ba0b57d3ec88db8204c288b81721f1cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}